<title>SINGAPORE: Thai Bangchak issues tender to buy August MTBE.</title>
<headline>Thai Bangchak issues tender to buy August MTBE.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Bangchak Petroleum Plc has issued a tender to buy 1,500 tonnes of methyl tertiary butyl ether (MTBE) for delivery in August, industry sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The tender for the gasoline octane booster closes on July 17 and offers are valid to July 18.</p>
<p>In its last tender, Bangchak bought a cargo for July delivery at $263 per tonne on a cost-and-freight basis to Thailand from Saudi Basic Industries Corp (SABIC).</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3093)</p>
